:"c74273"},"originalCharacterName":"弥生 春","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Haru is described to a calm and gentle young man, and is someone everyone relies on - practically a mother-type figure, with a big heart on the level of a \"holy mother\" or the Virgin Mary. He is looked up to by those younger than him, and those older than him rely on him, making him the type who couldn't be hated by anyone.4 He is apparently weak at arguing and tends to avoid conflict."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c74273"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2c/2c36e28e1c65f6e9eca1b118efc37fce1c1245fbe5071708cf3dd0ae9474317e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cb/cbcccc09e199671a7d7eea62e800ba7b9bcfeff2abfdcee16ddce8c9b09c5b49.webp","width":89,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"前野 智昭","creatorId":"vndb:s64","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s64","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s64","name":"前野 智昭","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:73645","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c74274","characterName":"卯月 新","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c74274"},"originalCharacterName":"卯月 新","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Arata is a laid-back, unhurried person who takes things at his own pace, often compared to a cat in a sunny area. He tends to be someone who sits at either end of the spectrum when it comes to work - he can be quite difficult to handle once he loses his enthusiasm, but he displays an overwhelming ability to concentrate and talent when it comes to interests, and goes all the way when having fun."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c74274"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5b/5be964b06f47524b2480b4c66753992044dcf4375f1f0cb9c8b3e2a5b79757f0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/08/084b9e164d4b07e67c56face31a102f9215152ab65187d25d7502eec8eebac67.webp","width":84,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"細谷 佳正","creatorId":"vndb:s251","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s251","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s251","name":"細谷 佳正","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:73652","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c74275","characterName":"皐月 葵","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c74275"},"originalCharacterName":"皐月 葵","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is described to be a refreshing person, to the point that he can be too refreshing. Very adult-like and level-headed, he, together with Yayoi Haru, look after and back-up the rest of Six Gravity."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c74275"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b9578ce6c14f00160d35f73900d10b5c7f86e1ea65ece7422925af140e9583e8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f3/f3e964298b420be45de5d07031fb952b7c31cf8e92e5b5fca717e67ca58d1d02.webp","width":96,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"KENN","creatorId":"vndb:s372","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s372","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s372","name":"KENN","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:73653","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c74276","characterName":"水無月 涙","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c74276"},"originalCharacterName":"水無月 涙","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rui comes off as innocent and naive, to the point that Shimotsuki Shun has (somewhat negatively) influenced his way of thinking. However, he can also do rather unexpected things whilst maintaining a straight face. He possesses a unique worldview, which makes him nonreactive to things such as scary stories."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c74276"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/07/07c236179ba47debf01b9db091d7e33b0b700001d82cdfd2e584f25c0cab4357.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8b/8ba04729b58858517b3c5d986edb7e1f4d20c7fece6894d2846f9c9efac1810f.webp","width":94,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"蒼井 翔太","creatorId":"vndb:s141","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s141","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s141","name":"蒼井 翔太","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:73649","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c74277","characterName":"文月 海","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c74277"},"originalCharacterName":"文月 海","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segme