He can also be very vague, the kind of person who ends up toying with other and causing them trouble. However, while he appears to be flashy and troublesome, he possesses a strong sense of duty and one-track mind, although according to him, he would rather die than show that side of him. He also possesses a unique sense of beauty and worldview."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c74278"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/65/65fbc4c4e2b1008394bcc23116d8bfd455a6820402ab89d800b1de5f91a3634c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/02/02255d5d543fbad393570e51fb019077d9a2bbcfd58af42af32d2222a7e90d6e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"柿原 徹也","creatorId":"vndb:s80","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s80","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s80","name":"柿原 徹也","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:73647","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c74279","characterName":"神無月 郁","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c74279"},"originalCharacterName":"神無月 郁","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Iku is lively, and athletic, preferring to be constantly in motion compared to staying still. He is the type who always looks forward and remains aware of those around him. He also exudes a natural aura of masculinity."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c74279"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e3/e3716c715186599d7f09a3004290cefa2e9ace3b086ea2b837ed868c545493b0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/87/87458251c7afe0501b54a606792f02644d23a2d00b458df2ccb8dddcd1f9a4a7.webp","width":90,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小野 賢章","creatorId":"vndb:s250","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s250","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s250","name":"小野 賢章","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:73651","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c74280","characterName":"霜月 隼","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c74280"},"originalCharacterName":"霜月 隼","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"hun is bizarre and unpredictable, doing what he pleases without much thought or restraint. He tends to have a meaningful smile on him, and behaves or speaks mysteriously, but his close friends would be able to tell that they don't actually hold any deep meaning. He is also playful and fun-loving. While he dislikes and is weak against obligation, and often pushes some of this tasks as Procellarum's leader to Kai, he can actually work very earnestly, although it is unknown what he thinks about during those moments."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c74280"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ea/ea40c1eed6d29f48d56f4e8434b70769081afd2cc11be70a2d849f9b7f812937.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f7/f79d9920755743c9e2179587891db6574004f0cf3783750eb5d2d9649a0bfe14.webp","width":100,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"木村 良平","creatorId":"vndb:s382","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s382","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s382","name":"木村 良平","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationI